    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any abnormalities and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape method</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not ignore any abnormalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an abnormality, immediately return to the pool entrance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormalities are found, proceed to the pool exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all abnormalities are discovered, find the real Pool No. 8 and leave through the exit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special tip</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have particularly scary abnormal designs, so you can play with peace of mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game duration is about 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are approximately 30 abnormalities in total.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly-finding game inspired by \u201cExit 8\u201d and \u201cFalseMall.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also my first independently completed beginner project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level of game production still needs practice and improvement, so I ask for your understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in anomaly-finding games, please add it to your wishlist. Thank you very much! This is a great encouragement for new developers!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any abnormalities and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape method</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not ignore any abnormalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an abnormality, immediately return to the pool entrance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no abnormalities are found, proceed to the pool exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all abnormalities are discovered, find the real Pool No. 8 and leave through the exit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special tip</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not have particularly scary abnormal designs, so you can play with peace of mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game duration is about 2 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are approximately 30 abnormalities in total.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly-finding game inspired by \u201cExit 8\u201d and \u201cFalseMall.\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also my first independently completed beginner project.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level of game production still needs practice and improvement, so I ask for your understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Thanks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in anomaly-finding games, please add it to your wishlist. Thank you very much! This is a great encouragement for new developers!</p>",
